{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["<b>It is man.</b> From the language of (I Samuel 1:5) מנה אחת אפים, and likewise (Leviticus 8:29) למשה היה למנה. Therefore Scripture gives the reason that they did not know what it was — that is, because they did not know what it was, they called it a portion from heaven and did not call it by a specific name, for they did not know its essence. And our Rabbi Hananel wrote: מן הוא, that is, 'from where is it,' because they did not know what it was."], :book :exodus, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 16, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:00:02.606245122Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}